Files in patches/ are unified diffs against vLLM source files as shipped in the
container image

    ghcr.io/yhfgyyf/vllm-deepseek-v4-sm89:0.28.1rc1-vision11-sm89-sm120-cu130

which contains vLLM 0.28.1rc1.dev517+glm53.dsv41.vision11.sm89sm120.cu130, a
community build that adds the DeepseekV4 architecture and the fp8_ds_mla KV
cache layout. The diffs modify the following upstream files:

    vllm/models/deepseek_v4_1/common/engram.py
    vllm/models/deepseek_v4/nvidia/model.py
    vllm/models/deepseek_v4_1/nvidia/router.py
    vllm/v1/worker/utils.py
    vllm/v1/worker/gpu_model_runner.py

No vLLM source file is redistributed here in full; only the changed hunks are
included, for the purpose of documenting and reproducing the modifications.

